{"id":"e8895988307cce12","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-separation-class.md","title":"分离集合构成有效闭类","display":"thm-separation-class — 分离集合构成有效闭类","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-separation-class","aliases":["20-thm-separation-class"],"display":"thm-separation-class — 分离集合构成有效闭类","chapter":"9","section":"9.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.3.2(i)","source_pdf_pages":[208],"source_printed_pages":[176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-separator]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-separation-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-separation-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separation-class — 分离集合构成有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.3.2(i)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=W_e\">\\(A=W_e\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=W_j\">\\(B=W_j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>；定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{e,j}=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall x&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [(x\\in W_{e,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=1)\\land(x\\in W_{j,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=0)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{e,j}=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall x&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [(x\\in W_{e,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=1)\\land(x\\in W_{j,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=0)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(\\{\\chi_S:S\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(\\{\\chi_S:S\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个阶段集有限可计算，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{e,j}\">\\(T_{e,j}\\)</span> 的指标由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,j)\">\\((e,j)\\)</span> 统一取得。单调枚举保证短前缀只需满足较少的条件，所以树向下閉合。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 分离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>，其所有前缀均在树中；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为路径，每个后来进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的元素在足够长的前缀中受到相应强制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 必分离。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 本身作为集合给一个分离者，所以不交条件还保证非空；不要求它可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.3.2(i)；印刷 176 / PDF 208。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-separator]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=W_e","display":false},{"tex":"B=W_j","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"T_{e,j}=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\forall x<|\\sigma|\\ [(x\\in W_{e,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=1)\\land(x\\in W_{j,|\\sigma|}\\Rightarrow\\sigma(x)=0)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separation\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(\\{\\chi_S:S\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{e,j}","display":false},{"tex":"(e,j)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1587d880757e9dd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-thm-separation-class]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-separation-class]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-separation-class]] — 章 9；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-separation-class]]"}],"outgoing":["9f5c300501e65ad4","b73290a0af01d44f","4ef1aee16db6b308","de14d8d6c42250de"]}